"""{{DCC}}MCP Addon — Socket server running inside {{PRETTY_DCC}}.

This file runs inside {{PRETTY_DCC}}'s Python environment. It creates a TCP socket server
that listens for JSON commands from the {{DCC}}MCP server, executes them in the main thread,
and returns structured JSON responses.

No external dependencies beyond what {{PRETTY_DCC}} ships with.

Usage:
    In {{PRETTY_DCC}}'s script editor or init.py:
        import {{dcc}}_mcp_addon
        {{dcc}}_mcp_addon.start()
"""

